      "id": "orgullo-de-steinitz",
      "title": {
        "es": "El orgullo del excampeón",
        "en": "The former champion's pride"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Con el match ya muy cuesta arriba, Steinitz ganó dos partidas seguidas, la 12 y la 13: fueron sus únicas victorias.",
        "en": "With the match already slipping away, Steinitz won two games in a row, 12 and 13: they were his only wins."
      },
      "round": 13
    },
